<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33443" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάτινος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Anaxil.
			22.17
		</span></i>: 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλάτινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, as also <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Hel.</u>
			1461
		</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
			<u>Hec.</u>
			632
		</span></i> (lyr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of
				the fir</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄζοι εἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.289
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1070
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλα εἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				632
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥητίνη</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.2.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					135.11
				</span></i>
			 (Olynthus, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>made of fir</i> or <i>pine-wood</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστὸς εἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.424
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1461
				</span></i>
			, cf. Anaxil.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of the date inflorescence</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.44
				</span></i>
			.</div>
